<title>USA: Lehman names Gonzalez Sordo country mgr for Mexico.</title>
<headline>Lehman names Gonzalez Sordo country mgr for Mexico.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said it named Manuel Gonzalez Sordo country manager for Mexico and managing director in the firm's investment banking group.</p>
<p>Before joing Lehman, Gozalez Sordo was an executive vice president at Grupo Financiero Santander, Lehman said.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1660 ))</p>
